      {
        "title": "Sum the series",
        "body": "$\\sum_{n\\ge0}\\frac{2^n}{n!}=e^2$ and $\\sum_{n\\ge0}\\frac{n\\,2^n}{n!}=2\\sum_{n\\ge1}\\frac{2^{n-1}}{(n-1)!}=2e^2$. So $y=(x+2)e^2$. The area is $e^2\\int_0^{2020}(x+2)\\,dx=e^2\\left(\\frac{2020^2}2+4040\\right)=(2040200+4040)e^2=2044240\\,e^2$.\n\n**Answer: $2044240\\,e^2$**"
      }
